flowchart TD
  A[Public home or shared URL] --> B[Published article and full bottom sources]
  B --> C[Inline claim citation]
  C --> D[Version-bound evidence view]
  D --> E[Exact original article, document or video]
  B --> F[Save or follow]
  F --> G{Authenticated?}
  G -->|No| H[Sign in and resume once]
  G -->|Yes| I[Private reader preference]
  H --> I
  J[Approved identity and scoped rights] --> K[Safe intake and immutable source versions]
  K --> L[Cluster, independent origins and claims]
  L --> M[Permissioned evidence pack]
  M --> N[Structured AI draft]
  N --> O[Validation and human review]
  O --> P{Valid rights, evidence and approvals?}
  P -->|No| Q[Hold, edit or reject]
  Q --> M
  P -->|Yes| R[Atomic publication and outbox]
  R --> B
  B --> S[Correction or rights report]
  S --> T[Investigate or immediately withdraw]
  T --> U[New reviewed version or tombstone]
  U --> R
